Package: nlmixr2sse
Title: Stochastic Simulation and Estimation for nlmixr2 Models
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Justin", "Wilkins", email = "justin.wilkins@occams.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7099-9396"))
  )
Maintainer: Justin Wilkins <justin.wilkins@occams.com>
Description: Stochastic simulation and estimation infrastructure for
    nlmixr2 fits, including fixed-parameter, raw-results-driven, and
    covariance-driven stochastic simulation and estimation workflows,
    canonical raw-results output, resumable run-directory setup, and
    shared summary tables for parameter bias and OFV-based power
    assessment.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
